  feedback --> intake
  intake -->|private invitation + reward offer| interview
  interview -->|agreed change| gate
  gate ok_1@-->|live, or async after the call| build
  gate blocked_1@-->|no implementation| explained
  build -->|new version| validate
  validate blocked_2@-->|falls short · no further change| explained
  validate async_1@-.->|falls short · change agreed| gate
  validate ok_2@-->|validated + all checks passed| delivered
  validate -->|participation complete| credit
  class delivered outcome
